 "lore": {
  "intro": "Coolant Row. The pumps have been louder\nlately. Nobody says so on record.",
  "radio": [
   {
    "trigger": "start",
    "text": "Ratio: Terms: you clear my decks, I open my doors, and we both pretend that's all this is. Pressure's uneven in the row. Don't stand in front of a line when it pops."
   },
   {
    "trigger": "enter_room:3",
    "text": "Ratio: That's pump bay two. Except you went in through bay one. I'm marking a relay fault. Again."
   },
   {
    "trigger": "pickup:red",
    "text": "Ratio: The row's valve wheel. The armory annex pressure hatch takes it \u2014 east end, and the lift out is inside."
   },
   {
    "trigger": "enter_room:2",
    "text": "Ratio: If you're going to loot my pump bays anyway, bay two holds sealed supplies. Consider it a retainer. I want to know what you see down there."
   },
   {
    "trigger": "enter_room:6",
    "text": "Ratio: That's the filter room. The things nesting in it used to be my cleaning swarm. Mind the floor."
   },
   {
    "trigger": "exit",
    "text": "Ratio: Row's clear. The count in Osei's log... forget it. Clock drift."
   }
  ],
  "terminals": [
   {
    "room": 3,
    "pos": [
     775.0,
     -70.0
    ],
    "text": "MAINT LOG 2280.11\nCrewman Osei walked Coolant Row end to end.\nCounted five hatches going. Counted six coming back.\nRecommend rest rotation for Osei."
   },
   {
    "room": 4,
    "pos": [
     808.0,
     95.0
    ],
    "text": "MAINT TICKET 4471\nCoolant flow, east tail: 210 l/min rated,\n212 measured, 209 after the bend.\nWhere do three liters a minute GO?\nStatus: closed. Reason: rounding."
   },
   {
    "room": 2,
    "pos": [
     255.0,
     -85.0
    ],
    "text": "MAINT LOG, PUMP BAY ONE\nCoolant pressure holds steady at spec, checked\nat the gauge. Flow rate does not match the\npressure. It should. The math connecting the two\nnumbers has not changed since the pumps were\nrated. Checked that too.\nFiled under: recalibrate flow sensor. Sensor\nrecalibrated. Numbers held."
   },
   {
    "room": 3,
    "pos": [
     775.0,
     0.0
    ],
    "text": "MAINT TICKET 4488 \u2014 FOLLOW-UP TO OSEI'S LOG\nRe-walked Coolant Row end to end, count taken\ntwice. Five hatches, both times, both directions.\nSchematic on file: five hatches. Schematic\nchecksum does not match the schematic filed\neleven months ago. Nobody has edited this file.\nStatus: closed, no fault found. Recommend against\nopening it again."
   },
   {
    "room": 5,
    "pos": [
     315.0,
     150.0
    ],
    "text": "SCRATCHED NEAR THE FLOOR VENT\ntally marks, forty-one of them, then nothing\nsomeone was counting seconds. or minutes. or\nhatches. whoever it was stopped at forty-one and\nleft the chalk on the ledge."
   },
   {
    "room": 6,
    "pos": [
     255.0,
     270.0
    ],
    "text": "FILTER SWAP PROCEDURE, POSTED\nIsolate the loop before pulling a filter: the\nisolation valve takes the loose handwheel racked\nby the manifold. One wheel serves the row \u2014 the\nsame square drive runs the armory annex pressure\nhatch at the east tail. Engineering never issued\na second wheel. Asked twice. Bring it back."
   }
  ]
 },
